}}'''Blue Gingerscythe''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife obtained by finishing in the top 100 on the gifting leaderboard during the [[Christmas Event 2023]]. 

== Appearance ==
It has the same mesh as the godly variant of [[Gingerscythe]], but it's color scheme has been altered to Blue-white colors. The handle of the sword is striped blue and white, similar to a regular Candy Cane.

== Trivia ==

* It has [[Silver Gingerscythe|silver]], [[Bronze Gingerscythe|bronze]] and [[Gold Gingerscythe|gold]] variants, as well as its [[Gingerscythe|EVO variant]].
* Like all other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (excluding [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].
* It was awarded to the top 100 players in the gifting leaderboard.
